<title>SOUTH KOREA: Port conditions update - S.Korea, Italy  - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - S.Korea, Italy  - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>BUSAN, Jan 13 -- Seventy vessels at berths and 116 at anchorage. Delay usually three to four days due to berth congestion.</p>
<p>ULSAN, Jan 13 - Eighty at berths and 40 at anchorage. Delay usually one to two days due to berth congestion.</p>
<p>TRIESTE, Jan 13 - At Porto Nogaro, Margreth quay fully operational since morning of Jan 11.</p>
</text>
